/P 58 0 R
/E (In 2024, BetterLife International Organization entered a major phase of program consolidation and scale-up, strengthening its position as a leading youth-driven climate and development organization in East and West Africa. Operating across Uganda, South Sudan, Tanzania, and Ghana, BetterLife delivered integrated solutions in climate education, refugee livelihoods, climate-smart agriculture, and digital innovation. Through strategic partnerships and community-led implementation, the organization directly impacted over 68,500 beneficiaries in 2024.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
