179 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 66 0 R
/T (In 2024, BetterLife International Organization continued to make meaningful progress in advancing climate resilience, sustainable livelihoods, and community empowerment across Uganda, South Sudan, Tanzania, and Ghana. Through targeted programmes, we engaged over 60,000 individuals, focusing on climate-smart agriculture, youth leadership development, environmental conservation, and livelihood support for vulnerable communities. Our initiatives included conducting climate education programmes in rural schools, establishing climate-smart agriculture demonstration farms, expanding the SMILES livelihood programme for refugee and host communities, and strengthening community-based recycling initiatives to reduce environmental pollution. These efforts not only increased awareness of environmental challenges but also equipped communities with practical skills and resources to adapt to climate change and improve household livelihoods.)
/E (In 2024, BetterLife International Organization continued to make meaningful progress in advancing climate resilience, sustainable livelihoods, and community empowerment across Uganda, South Sudan, Tanzania, and Ghana. Through targeted programmes, we engaged over 60,000 individuals, focusing on climate-smart agriculture, youth leadership development, environmental conservation, and livelihood support for vulnerable communities. Our initiatives included conducting climate education programmes in rural schools, establishing climate-smart agriculture demonstration farms, expanding the SMILES livelihood programme for refugee and host communities, and strengthening community-based recycling initiatives to reduce environmental pollution. These efforts not only increased awareness of environmental challenges but also equipped communities with practical skills and resources to adapt to climate change and improve household livelihoods.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
180 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 66 0 R
/E (Looking ahead, BetterLife International aims to expand its programmes by strengthening farmer training initiatives, increasing youth participation in climate leadership, and supporting more community enterprises through sustainable livelihood programmes. We remain committed to building resilient communities by scaling climate-smart agriculture solutions, expanding community training centres, and strengthening partnerships that promote environmental sustainability and economic opportunity.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
