/E (Our key achievements in 2024 included the establishment of new climate-smart agriculture demonstration sites that trained thousands of farmers and youth in sustainable farming practices, as well as the expansion of community livelihood programmes that supported women and young people in developing income-generating activities. These initiatives contributed to improving food security, increasing incomes, and strengthening community resilience to climate-related challenges.)
