<<
/Title (This report details our major accomplishments in 2024, highlighting the scale-up of climate education in over 120 schools, the expansion of BetterLife Green Libraries and Eco Innovation Hubs, the strengthening of the SMILES livelihoods programme in refugee and host communities, and the successful rollout of the Soilla climate-smart agriculture platform to thousands of smallholder farmers.)
/Dest [10 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 207 0 R
/Next 545 0 R
>>
